00:03:58.304 --> 00:04:01.374
LAW INTO CALIFORNIA'S ICWA LAW,

00:04:01.441 --> 00:04:02.275
STRENGTHENING PROTECTIONS FOR

00:04:02.342 --> 00:04:04.711
CALIFORNIA INDIAN CHILDREN. LAST

00:04:04.777 --> 00:04:07.647
YEAR, THE UNITED STATES SUPREME

00:04:07.714 --> 00:04:10.817
