00:04:10.883 --> 00:04:12.552
CHALLENGE OF ICWA. THERE WAS A

00:04:12.619 --> 00:04:13.720
CHALLENGE THAT TOOK ON CALLED

00:04:13.786 --> 00:04:15.622
HOLLAND AND BRACKEN, AND THE

00:04:15.688 --> 00:04:18.391
U.S. SUPREME COURT SIDED WITH

00:04:18.458 --> 00:04:21.327
INDIAN CHILDREN. THIS IS A MAJOR

00:04:21.394 --> 00:04:22.462
VICTORY FOR TRIBAL NATIONS IN

00:04:22.528 --> 00:04:24.731
CALIFORNIA AND THE FUTURE OF

00:04:24.797 --> 00:04:26.966
TRIBAL CULTURES. THE DECISION

00:04:27.033 --> 00:04:28.067
AFFIRMS WHAT TRIBAL NATIONS HAVE

00:04:28.134 --> 00:04:30.470
LONG KNOWN. ICWA IS THE BEST

00:04:30.536 --> 00:04:32.305
PRACTICE IN CHILD WELFARE, AND

00:04:32.372 --> 00:04:34.040
DESERVES TO BE UPHELD IN THE

00:04:34.107 --> 00:04:35.875
UNITED STATES AND IN THE STATE

00:04:35.942 --> 00:04:37.877
OF CALIFORNIA. WHILE THE SUPREME

00:04:37.944 --> 00:04:38.945
COURT REJECTED ALL CLAIMS

00:04:39.012 --> 00:04:40.847
AGAINST ICWA, THERE ARE SPACES

00:04:40.913 --> 00:04:43.583
THAT CALIFORNIA CAN ADDRESS AND

00:04:43.650 --> 00:04:44.784
UPDATE TO SHIELD CALIFORNIA

00:04:44.851 --> 00:04:46.653
TRIBES AGAINST FUTURE

00:04:46.719 --> 00:04:47.587
CHALLENGES. THIS BILL WOULD

00:04:47.654 --> 00:04:49.489
STRENGTHEN THE LAWS SURROUNDING

00:04:49.555 --> 00:04:52.158
INDIAN CHILD CUSTODY AND

00:04:52.225 --> 00:04:53.993
PROCEEDINGS PROTECTING

00:04:54.060 --> 00:04:55.028
CALIFORNIA'S FIRST PEOPLE. WITH

