00:06:46.405 --> 00:06:47.340
WILL ALSO REAFFIRM ICWA

00:06:47.406 --> 00:06:49.509
PROTECTIONS, APPLY TO ALL INDIAN

00:06:49.575 --> 00:06:51.310
